<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n89814" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προσοιστέος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">α</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προσφέρω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>to be added
				to</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐ προσοιστέος ἄλλος [θάνατος] πρὸς
					ἄλλῳ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Hec.</u>
					394
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στέφανος π</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Alex.
				250
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>to be offered</i>, [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θεῷ</span>]
				<i><span class="en">
				Jul.
				<u>Ep.</u>
				89b
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προσοιστέον</span>
			<i>one must apply</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρέπουσαν μηχανήν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Th.</u>
					1132
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Phdr.</u>
				272a
			</span></i>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γυμνάσια</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Pol.</u>
					1338b40
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b> (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προσφέρομαι</span>) <i>to be administered</i>
			(as food or medicine), <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ π</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Acut.</u>
				3
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προσοιστέον</span>
			<i>one must deal with</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τισι</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Aristid.
				<u>Or.</u>
				33(51).15
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
